    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>The Arc Pistol fires a bolt of concentrated electromagnetic energy that can be charged for a more powerful shot at the cost of a brief delay. Standard fire delivers rapid electrical strikes against shielded targets; a charged shot releases a focused arc that tears through barrier fields and delivers a massive voltage spike to whatever is behind them. Quarian engineers originally developed it for hull cutting work; its adoption as a combat sidearm was an obvious next step.</p>"
